msgid ""
"As part of the handshake process, the client must send a `Sec-WebSocket-"
"Extensions` header to advertise that it supports the registered "
"extensions. This header should be generated using:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/websocket-extensions_README.md:99
msgid ""
"This returns a string, for example `\"permessage-deflate; "
"client_max_window_bits\"`, that represents all the extensions the client "
"is offering to use, and their parameters. This string may contain "
"multiple offers for the same extension."
