msgid ""
"This returns the set of parameters the server session wants to send in "
"its `Sec-WebSocket-Extensions` response header. Only one set of "
"parameters is returned to the client per extension. Server sessions that "
"would confict on their use of RSV bits are not activated."
msgstr ""

